{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40863","headline":"山中卧寄卢郎中 · 伍唐珪","name":"山中卧寄卢郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年耕钓水云间，住僻家贫少往还。\n一径绿苔凝晓露，满头白发对青山。\n野僧采药来医病，樵客携觞爲解颜。\n空恋旧时恩奖地，无因匍匐出柴关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍唐珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}